RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Zapata County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years. In 2025, October to November ran 13% of normal and November to December ran 18% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 8523 had its driest year in 2011 at 40% of normal.</p>"}
